abBar__firstTabItemMobile__eKv82\"><span>\n                  Tính năng\n                </span></div> <ul class=\"ProductTabBar__subTabListMobile__mrIWV\" style=\"height:0px;\"><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem firstTabItem ProductTabBar__firstTabItem__FE3gO\"><span>\n                    Tính năng\n                  </span></li> </ul></li> <li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Thông số kỹ thuật\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS ProductTabBar__active__N4qFo\"><span>\n                Giải thưởng\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Thư viện\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Nơi mua\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Hỗ trợ\n              </span></li></ul></div></div> <!----> <div class=\"ProductAwards__productAwardPage__DePl3\"><!----> <div class=\"ProductAwards__awardTabs__2vloX\"><ul role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Awards, Meidas, and Videos\" style=\"width:1520px;\"><li aria-selected=\"true\" aria-label=\"ROG Delta S Core Awards, Meidas, and Videos\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards tabpanel-video tabpanel-media\" id=\"All\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Delta S Core Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Delta S Core Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Delta S Core Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(4)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202307071643398170055.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gamezoom buy recommendation 90%\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      gamezoom.net\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gamezoom buy recommendation 90%</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ASUS delivers a great gaming headset at a fair price with the new ROG Delta S Core. Besides the impeccable build quality and the great wearing comfort (low weight, soft padding), the very good microphone is also convincing.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>07/05/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta S Core Media review Award of Gamezoom buy recommendation 90%\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gamezoom.net/artikel/ASUS_ROG_Delta_S_Core_Test_Review-52653-all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202412050511579010644.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Very Good\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Computer\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Very Good</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The first observation about the Asus model is the plastic earcup holders including the joints. Here we can already be concerned about their durability. On the other hand, we must definitely praise the generous padding of the earcups with memory foam. In combination with the not very significant side pressure, these are subjectively the most comfortable earcups in the test.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>11/15/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta S Core Media review Award of Very Good\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.zive.cz/clanky/prosincovy-computer-a-megatest-11-grafickych-karet-vime-ktera-je-nejlepsi-pro-kazdy-rozpocet/sc-3-a-231612/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202407020017119150439.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Very Good\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Superparmeni.eu\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Very Good</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The price for the Asus ROG Delta S Core gaming headphones (just under CZK 2,000) is set to match their higher quality and top-notch sound. Compared to other models in the same category, this is a very reasonable investment.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>06/17/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta S Core Media review Award of Very Good\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://superparmeni.eu/reviews/recenze-asus-rog-delta-s-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/201911212011036520861.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.ddworld.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Overall, I think that those who buy around CZK 1,500 value headphones will be quite excited about the Asus ROG Delta S Core. For the very acceptable money, it is a high-quality, albeit basic, but sensibly made gaming headset in all respects, without any obvious compromises.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>02/22/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta S Core Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://www.ddworld.cz/pc-a-komponenty/periferie/asus-rog-delta-s-core-test-a-recenze-zakladnich-ale-opravdu-dobrych-hernich-sluchatek.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoWrapper__-NXix\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewTitle__0lBVH\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 class=\"pageVideo vnRogFont ProductAwardVideo__vnRogFontSize__n4Ouu\">Video review</h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(8)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContentScroll__+rpKV\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContainer__SWxvv\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__revie